sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant HMI
  participant Main as ESP32-S3 main.cpp
  participant Sonar as Ultrasonic sensor
  participant Cam as ESP32-CAM peer
  participant Servo as Sorting servo
  User->>HMI: START
  HMI-->>Main: UART button frame
  Main->>HMI: Reset counters / page 2
  loop Bottle acceptance
    Main->>Sonar: Trigger and measure
    Sonar-->>Main: Pulse duration / timeout
  end
  Main->>Cam: START command
  loop Exactly 3 prediction messages
    Cam-->>Main: prediction + timestamp
  end
  Main->>Cam: STOP command
  alt Green or white majority
    Main->>Servo: Move matching servo to 70 degrees and home
    Main->>HMI: Update count and earning
  else Unknown/no majority
    Main->>Main: No reward
  end
  Main->>Sonar: Wait until distance >= 25 cm
  User->>HMI: Withdraw
  Main->>HMI: Page 1 and text payload at VP 0x1010
  Note over HMI,Main: No payment processing or transfer is implemented
